  "extract": "Jenny Odell is an American multidisciplinary artist, writer, and educator based in Oakland, California. She taught Internet art and digital/physical design at Stanford University from 2013 to 2021. She wrote The New York Times best-selling book How to Do Nothing: Resisting the Attention Economy (2019).",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Jenny Odell</b> is an American multidisciplinary artist, writer, and educator based in Oakland, California. She taught Internet art and digital/physical design at Stanford University from 2013 to 2021. She wrote <span><i>The</i> <i>New York Times</i></span> best-selling book <i>How to Do Nothing: Resisting the Attention Economy</i> (2019).</p>"
